<item><title>South Sudan Supreme Court directs Ajing to seek release from prosecutor</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-supreme-court-directs-ajing-to-seek-release-250025/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/south-sudan-supreme-court-directs-ajing-to-seek-release-250025/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The court said it cannot order temporary release while the former presidential office director’s criminal case remains under investigation.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:12:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Jonglei plans to move 135 Akobo exam candidates to Bor</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/jonglei-plans-to-move-135-akobo-exam-candidates-to-bor-7e5b5d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/jonglei-plans-to-move-135-akobo-exam-candidates-to-bor-7e5b5d/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The state says it will cover food and accommodation, but opposition officials and parents are still deciding whether to accept the plan.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:59:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Juba council sets 10 million SSP fine for selling alcohol to minors</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/juba-council-sets-10-million-ssp-fine-for-selling-alcohol-73f83b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/juba-council-sets-10-million-ssp-fine-for-selling-alcohol-73f83b/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The order also fines bars and shops for mixing alcohol with food and took effect on Monday after the caretaker mayor signed it.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:59:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
